          "developerName": "Kahoot!",
          "longDescription": "Transform any topic, document, or link into a live, interactive learning session in seconds. Upload a PDF, paste meeting notes, or describe your idea, and AI will automatically generate a ready-to-play multiple-choice activity tailored to your needs—whether you're a teacher designing formative assessments, a manager running zero-prep icebreakers, or a student creating personalized flashcards.\n\nOnboarding prompts:\n“Turn my study notes into a kahoot I can practice with”\n“Make a 10-question game from this article”\n“Create a quick knowledge check for my team”\n“Build an onboarding kahoot for new employees”\n“Create an icebreaker game for a team meeting”\n\nCategory tags:\nQuiz Maker, Interactive Quiz, Formative Assessment, Employee Training, Engagement, Education, Study Tools, Trivia, Team Meeting, Test Prep",
          "longDescriptionZh": "在几秒钟内将任何主题、文档或链接转变为实时的交互式学习课程。上传 PDF、粘贴会议记录或描述您的想法，人工智能将自动生成适合您需求的即用型多项选择活动，无论您是设计形成性评估的教师、运行零准备破冰游戏的经理，还是创建个性化抽认卡的学生。\n\n入职提示：\n“把我的学习笔记变成我可以练习的卡胡特”\n“根据这篇文章制作一个 10 个问题的游戏”\n“为我的团队创建快速知识检查”\n“为新员工建立入职培训”\n“为团队会议创建一个破冰游戏”\n\n分类标签：\n测验制作、互动测验、形成性评估、员工培训、参与、教育、学习工具、琐事、团队会议、考试准备",
