          "longDescription": "This connector lets ChatGPT and Codex securely read from and write to QuickBooks Online.\n\nSome things you can do:\n• Connect multiple QuickBooks Online companies to the same agent (great for booking intercompany JEs)\n• Choose read-only or read-write access separately for each company\n• Create arbitrary QuickBooks transactions, including journal entries\n• Bulk-create invoices or import credit card transactions\n• Upload and attach receipts and supporting files to QuickBooks transactions\n• Automatically fill in your firm-specific reporting template\n• The craziest use case I tried was \"Clone the contents of QBO A into QBO B\", and… it worked",
          "longDescriptionZh": "此连接器可让 ChatGPT 和 Codex 安全地读取和写入 QuickBooks Online。\n\n您可以做的一些事情：\n• 将多个 QuickBooks Online 公司连接到同一代理（非常适合预订公司间 JE）\n• 为每个公司单独选择只读或读写访问权限\n• 创建任意QuickBooks 交易，包括日记账分录\n• 批量创建发票或导入信用卡交易\n• 将收据和支持文件上传并附加到 QuickBooks 交易中\n• 自动填写您公司特定的报告模板\n• 我尝试过的最疯狂的用例是“将 QBO A 的内容克隆到 QBO B 中”，并且......它起作用了",
          "productIntro": "QBO Connector by Meridian 连接 QuickBooks Online，可按授权范围读取或更新会计与财务记录。",
