          "developerName": "LiftTrack, LLC",
          "longDescription": "LiftTrack is a strength training app for Garmin users that lets you build custom workouts on your phone, sync them to your Garmin watch, and track your progress over time. It's purpose-built for weightlifters — with features like an unlimited exercise library, superset support, rest timers, RPE logging, warmup calculators, and AI-powered workout creation. If you don't have the app yet, download LiftTrack on iOS or Android at lifttrackapp.com.\n\nOnce connected, ChatGPT can access your real workout templates and completed sessions, so you stay in one chat while your data does the work.\n\nGoals you can accomplish\n\nPlan your week — Ask \"What did I do last week?\" or \"What's in my Push template?\" and get answers from your actual workouts and templates so ChatGPT can suggest what to do next.\n\nStay on program — Have ChatGPT remind you what's in a given workout, what weight and sets you did last time, or what you're supposed to do today.\n\nReview and adjust — Ask for summaries by week or month (\"How many sessions did I do?\" \"How did my squat progress?\") and use that to adjust volume or intensity.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "LiftTrack 是一款面向 Garmin 用户的力量训练应用程序，可让您在手机上构建自定义锻炼，将其同步到您的 Garmin 手表，并跟踪一段时间内的进度。它专为举重运动员打造，具有无限练习库、超级组支持、休息计时器、RPE 记录、热身计算器和人工智能驱动的锻炼创建等功能。如果您还没有该应用程序，请访问 lifttrackapp.com 下载 iOS 或 Android 版 LiftTrack。\n\n连接后，ChatGPT 可以访问您真实的锻炼模板和已完成的训练，因此您可以在数据完成工作时保持在一个聊天中。\n\n您可以实现的目标\n\n计划你的一周——问“我上周做了什么？”或“我的推送模板中有什么？”并从您的实际锻炼和模板中获取答案，以便 ChatGPT 可以建议下一步该做什么。\n\n坚持计划 — 让 ChatGPT 提醒您特定锻炼的内容、您上次的重量和组数，或者您今天应该做什么。\n\n回顾和调整——要求按周或按月进行总结（“我做了多少次训练？”“我的深蹲进展如何？”）并用它来调整训练量或强度。",
          "productIntro": "LiftTrack 是面向 Garmin 用户的力量训练工具，可规划训练、同步手表并追踪动作与进度。",
          "productIntroEn": "LiftTrack is a service that helps you weightlifting For Garmin. In Codex, it is most useful when a task needs the service’s information or actions to be combined with reasoning, files, or other tools.",
          "websiteUrl": "https://lifttrackapp.com",
