          "developerName": "SciSpace",
          "longDescription": "SciSpace for ChatGPT supports the core tasks of research: discovery, triage, and synthesis.\n\nUse it to search for academic papers and review them in a customizable table with metadata and links. Add structured columns - abstract, summary, methods, results, conclusions - to quickly assess relevance and quality. Then use the collected list as the basis for literature review notes, thematic synthesis, and targeted follow-up searches.\n\nGet started with prompts like: \n1.  \"SciSpace Find papers on impact of nanoplastics on gut health\"\n2. \"SciSpace How does climate change impact biodiversity?\"",
          "longDescriptionZh": "SciSpace for ChatGPT 支持研究的核心任务：发现、分类和综合。\n\n使用它来搜索学术论文并在带有元数据和链接的可自定义表格中进行审查。添加结构化栏 - 摘要、摘要、方法、结果、结论 - 以快速评估相关性和质量。然后将收集到的列表作为文献综述笔记、主题综合和有针对性的后续检索的基础。\n\n开始使用以下提示： \n1.“SciSpace 查找有关纳米塑料对肠道健康影响的论文”\n2.“SciSpace 气候变化如何影响生物多样性？”",
