          "longDescription": "Talarion keeps AI current. Frontier models don't know about recent events, and web search can't answer questions LLMs don't know to ask. Talarion proactively tells your AI what it's missing before it starts researching to prevent critical omissions and judgement errors. Install the MCP to make sure your AI assistant knows what it would otherwise be missing.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "Talarion 让 AI 保持最新状态。前沿模型不了解最近发生的事件，网络搜索无法回答法学硕士不知道要问的问题。 Talarion 在开始研究之前主动告诉您的人工智能它缺少什么，以防止重大遗漏和判断错误。安装 MCP 以确保您的 AI 助手知道否则它会丢失什么。",
