          "longDescription": "Massive brings institutional-grade market data directly into ChatGPT. Query real-time and historical stocks data, options data, futures data, indices data, forex data, and crypto data through Massive.com's financial data API — no code or scraping required.\n\nStocks & equities: Real-time stock prices, historical stock data, tick-level trades and quotes, OHLC aggregates and candlestick bars, market snapshots, and stock ticker reference data for all US equities and ETFs, sourced from all US exchanges.\n\nOptions: Options contracts data including options chains, options prices, quotes, trades, open interest, and historical options data across the full US listed options market.\n\nFutures: Futures market data including futures contracts, futures prices, trades, quotes, and historical futures data across major products.\n\nIndices: Real-time and historical index data including index values and aggregates for major market indices.\n\nForex & crypto: Currency pairs, exchange rates, crypto prices, and historical FX and cryptocurrency market data.\n\nBeyond prices, pull company fundamentals and financials, corporate actions like dividends and stock splits, market news, technical indicators (SMA, EMA, MACD, RSI), and market status. Ask ChatGPT natural-language questions — \"show me NVDA's opening cross\" or \"chart AAPL's daily bars this quarter\" — and get answers backed by licensed, exchange-sourced market data.\n\nBuilt for traders, quants, analysts, and developers who need accurate stock market data, equities data, and multi-asset market data inside ChatGPT.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "Massive 将机构级市场数据直接引入 ChatGPT。通过 Massive.com 的金融数据 API 查询实时和历史股票数据、期权数据、期货数据、指数数据、外汇数据和加密数据 - 无需代码或抓取。\n\n股票和股票：来自所有美国交易所的所有美国股票和 ETF 的实时股票价格、历史股票数据、变动水平交易和报价、OHLC 聚合和烛台条、市场快照以及股票报价参考数据。\n\n期权：期权合约数据，包括整个美国上市期权市场的期权链、期权价格、报价、交易、未平仓合约和历史期权数据。\n\n期货：期货市场数据，包括主要产品的期货合约、期货价格、交易、报价和历史期货数据。\n\n指数：实时和历史指数数据，包括主要市场指数的指数值和汇总。\n\n外汇和加密货币：货币对、汇率、加密货币价格以及历史外汇和加密货币市场数据。\n\n除了价格之外，还应了解公司基本面和财务状况、股息和股票分割等公司行为、市场新闻、技术指标（SMA、EMA、MACD、RSI）和市场状况。询问 ChatGPT 自然语言问题 - “显示 NVDA 的开盘交叉”或“绘制 AAPL 本季度的每日柱形图” - 并获得由许可的、交易所来源的市场数据支持的答案。\n\n专为需要 ChatGPT 内准确股票市场数据、股票数据和多资产市场数据的交易者、量化分析师、分析师和开发人员而构建。",
