          "developerName": "trivago",
          "longDescription": "The trivago MCP server lets users search for hotels and other accommodations by travel dates and location, from countries and cities to specific venues, landmarks, or other points of interest. Using the details provided, it returns tailored hotel options with prices from multiple booking sites, plus photos, key accommodation details, and helpful links to learn more. In simple terms, it gives AI assistants an efficient way to help users find the right stay at the right price.\n\nYou can use the trivago app for \n\nSearch hotels by destination and dates:\n\"Find me a hotel in Las Vegas for 2 people from 12 July to 20 July 2026\"\n\nFind budget accommodation near landmarks:\n\"I need a cheap accommodation near the Eiffel Tower for 1 night the 12th of June 2026\"\n\nBook hotels near event venues:\n\"Find me a hotel near the Etihad Stadium for 12 July to 14 July 2026\"\n\nCoordinate travel with conferences:\n\"I need accommodation close to the venue of the next KubeCon happening in Europe in 2026\"\n\nPlan family vacations:\n\"I am searching for 2 rooms for 2 adults and 2 children aged 6 and 10 in Barcelona for Easter 2026\"",
          "longDescriptionZh": "trivago MCP 服务器允许用户根据旅行日期和地点搜索酒店和其他住宿，从国家和城市到特定地点、地标或其他兴趣点。使用所提供的详细信息，它会返回定制的酒店选项，其中包括多个预订网站的价格、照片、主要住宿详细信息以及了解更多信息的有用链接。简单来说，它为人工智能助手提供了一种有效的方式来帮助用户以合适的价格找到合适的住宿。\n\n您可以使用 trivago 应用程序 \n\n按目的地和日期搜索酒店：\n“2026 年 7 月 12 日至 7 月 20 日期间，为我在拉斯维加斯找到一家适合 2 人入住的酒店”\n\n寻找靠近地标的经济住宿：\n“我需要在 2026 年 6 月 12 日在埃菲尔铁塔附近找个便宜的住宿住一晚”\n\n预订活动场地附近的酒店：\n“为我寻找 2026 年 7 月 12 日至 14 日期间阿提哈德体育场附近的酒店”\n\n协调差旅与会议：\n“我需要靠近 2026 年在欧洲举行的下一届 KubeCon 会场的住宿”\n\n计划家庭度假：\n“我正在巴塞罗那寻找 2 间适合 2 名成人和 2 名 6 岁和 10 岁儿童的 2026 年复活节房间”",
          "productIntro": "trivago 的主要用途是快速搜索和比较酒店。 trivago MCP 服务器允许用户根据旅行日期和地点搜索酒店和其他住宿，从国家和城市到特定地点、地标或其他兴趣点。在 Codex 中，可结合当前任务使用它提供的资料或能力。",
          "productIntroEn": "trivago is a service that helps you find your ideal hotel, fast. In Codex, it is most useful when a task needs the service’s information or actions to be combined with reasoning, files, or other tools.",
