          "longDescription": "Kick-start your tarot reading right inside ChatGPT. Ask AI Tarot to shuffle digital tarot cards, lay a three-card spread, and return clear, private divination insights—no ads or waiting rooms.\n\nHow to Use Tarot in ChatGPT\n\n1. Connect: Connect the Tarot app to ChatGPT.\n2. Trigger: Type Commands: Simply type \"@\" then choose the Tarot app, or type “Tarot” (followed by a space) in the chat box.\n3. Create: You are ready to go! Try asking specifically:\n\"Pull tarot cards for my love life.\"\n\"Draw three tarot cards and interpret the spread for my upcoming week.\"\n“Provide a three-card tarot reading on balancing work and health.”\n\nWant to dive deeper? Keep asking follow-ups in chat or open the full app for richer symbolism and saved readings.",
          "longDescriptionZh": "在 ChatGPT 中开始您的塔罗牌占卜。让人工智能塔罗牌洗数字塔罗牌，打出三张牌，并返回清晰、私人的占卜见解——没有广告或等候室。\n\n如何在 ChatGPT 中使用塔罗牌\n\n1. 连接：将 Tarot 应用程序连接到 ChatGPT。\n2. 触发：键入命令：只需键入“@”，然后选择 Tarot 应用程序，或在聊天框中键入“Tarot”（后跟空格）。\n3. 创建：您已准备就绪！尝试具体询问：\n“为我的爱情生活抽塔罗牌。”\n“抽三张塔罗牌，解读我接下来一周的牌面。”\n“提供关于平衡工作和健康的三张塔罗牌占卜。”\n\n想深入了解吗？继续在聊天中询问后续内容或打开完整的应用程序以获得更丰富的象征意义和保存的读数。",
